msgid "Fake GPS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/modules/fakegps.rst:12
#: 4205b61f5c8f4494a01eb905e09a6770
msgid "This allows MAVProxy to substitute a fakegps signal into the autopilot or simulation. This provides an easy means to simulate a given location and/or altitude to the autopilot/sim for testing features like terrain altitude, etc. while still on the bench."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/modules/fakegps.rst:14
#: ea7f1eae9f394f428fd8d4c84ee50e14
msgid "In order to use it after the module is loaded, you must change :ref:`GPS1_TYPE<GPS1_TYPE>` to \"14\" (MAVLink) so that GPS data is supplied via MAVLink commands."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/modules/fakegps.rst:16
#: f04f262fc7ca4e12b7b5cb8e8ad91fdc
msgid "Autopilots with less than 2MB of flash do not have the MAVLink type GPS backend compiled in by default. Use the custom build server to create a firmware that does in order to use this module."
msgstr ""

